# This "Insight" OneDrive folder holds a lot more than the GitHub repo --
# client documents, an Oracle wallet (private keys), spreadsheets, ad-hoc
# screenshots, etc. -- none of which belong in git. Rather than trying to
# blacklist each sensitive thing individually (easy to miss one), this
# ignores EVERYTHING by default and only whitelists the paths that are
# actually meant to be this repo: the GitHub Actions workflows, the
# INSIGHT_oracle_26node_apex_python_container project folder, and
# INSIGHT_app.html (tracked so CI can diff it against web/index.html and
# catch the two copies drifting -- see ci.yml). Anything new dropped into
# this OneDrive folder is untracked unless explicitly whitelisted below.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/INSIGHT_oracle_26node_apex_python_container/
!/INSIGHT_app.html
